  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Rahgot brings down splitting ice spikes from above.
  - Rahgot brings down fireballs from above.
  - Rahgot carefully aims a targeted lightning strike at Natsuki.
  - Rahgot flings snowballs from the side. (Snow golem?!?)
  - Rahgot unleashes a small snowstorm on the group.
  - Rahgot unleashes a larger snowstorm on the group.
  - Rahgot surrounds the group with small fireballs. Again.
