  defeatText: With the final blow dealt, Rahgot's form dissolves into a pile of ash,
    leaving his mask ripe for the taking.
  nameText: Rahgot
  blurbText: Yeah, I'm just gonna keep reusing the same visual asset for dragon priests.
    The added detail from having the right colored mask isn't worth the extra storage
    space.
